<font size=5>Onward to Phase III!</font>
<br>
<i>UI Eco-Hydraulics Group (UI)</i>
<p>

During the week of August 10th, Steve Clayton walked the channel and floodplain from the upstream end of the Giblers' property through the downstream end of the Red River Wildlife Management Area.  He made notes on current channel and floodplain conditions to serve as a tool in developing design plans for Phase III.  Steve will present these summary notes along with the original design criteria, revisions to the original criteria, and proposed design ideas for Phase III to the TAC for input and discussion on September 8th.

